[chant:0003 dedication-of-offerings]
[00:00.00]1 [Yo so] bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho
[00:11.40]2 Svākkhāto yena bhagavatā dhammo
[00:18.60]3 Supaṭipanno yassa bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[00:27.02]4 Tam-mayaṁ bhagavantaṁ sadhammaṁ sasaṅghaṁ
[00:33.71]5 Imehi sakkārehi yathārahaṁ āropitehi abhipūjayāma
[00:45.10]6 Sādhu no bhante bhagavā sucira-parinibbutopi
[00:53.47]7 Pacchimā-janatānukampa-mānasā
[00:59.74]8 Ime sakkāre duggata-paṇṇākāra-bhūte paṭiggaṇhātu
[01:10.47]9 Amhākaṁ dīgharattaṁ hitāya sukhāya
[01:17.91]10 Arahaṁ sammāsambuddho bhagavā
[01:24.57]11 Buddhaṁ bhagavantaṁ abhivādemi
[01:31.97]12 [Svākkhāto] bhagavatā dhammo
[01:41.11]13 Dhammaṁ namassāmi
[01:46.43]14 [Supaṭipanno] bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[01:55.41]15 Saṅghaṁ namāmi

[chant:0004 preliminary-homage]
[02:00.17]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhassa bhagavato pubbabhāga-namakāraṁ karomase
[02:09.84]2 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa
[02:20.08]2 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa
[02:29.48]2 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa

[chant:0010 recollection-of-the-buddha]
[02:39.19]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhānussatinayaṁ karomase
[02:45.92]2 Taṁ kho pana bhagavantaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato
[02:58.24]3 Itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho
[03:05.60]4 Vijjācaraṇa-sampanno sugato lokavidū
[03:12.51]5 Anuttaro purisadamma-sārathi satthā deva-manussānaṁ buddho bhagavā'ti

[chant:0011 supreme-praise-of-the-buddha]
[03:26.44]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhābhigītiṁ karomase
[03:34.25]2 Buddh'vārahanta-varatādiguṇābhiyutto
[03:42.13]3 Suddhābhiñāṇa-karuṇāhi samāgatatto
[03:48.68]4 Bodhesi yo sujanataṁ kamalaṁ va sūro
[03:55.43]5 Vandām'ahaṁ tam-araṇaṁ sirasā jinendaṁ
[04:02.02]6 Buddho yo sabba-pāṇīnaṁ saraṇaṁ khemam-uttamaṁ
[04:10.35]7 Paṭhamānussatiṭṭhānaṁ vandāmi taṁ siren'ahaṁ
[04:18.04]8 Buddhassāh'asmi dāso va buddho me sāmi-kissaro
[04:26.58]9 Buddho dukkhassa ghātā ca vidhātā ca hitassa me
[04:34.50]10 Buddhass'āhaṁ niyyādemi sarīrañ-jīvitañ-cidaṁ
[04:42.25]11 Vandanto'haṁ carissāmi buddhass'eva subodhitaṁ
[04:50.42]12 Natthi me saraṇaṁ aññaṁ buddho me saraṇaṁ varaṁ
[04:58.02]13 Etena sacca-vajjena vaḍḍheyyaṁ satthu-sāsane
[05:06.18]14 Buddhaṁ me vandamānena yaṁ puññaṁ pasutaṁ idha
[05:13.79]15 Sabbepi antarāyā me māhesuṁ tassa tejasā
[05:23.33]17 Kāyena vācāya va cetasā vā
[05:27.17]18 Buddhe kukammaṁ pakataṁ mayā yaṁ
[05:31.01]19 Buddho paṭiggaṇhātu accayantaṁ
[05:36.29]20 Kālantare saṁvarituṁ va buddhe

[chant:0012 recollection-of-the-dhamma]
[05:41.29]1 Handa mayaṁ dhammānussatinayaṁ karomase
[05:48.52]2 Svākkhāto bhagavatā dhammo
[05:54.81]3 Sandiṭṭhiko akāliko ehipassiko
[06:01.20]4 Opanayiko paccattaṁ veditabbo viññūhī'ti

[chant:0013 supreme-praise-of-the-dhamma]
[06:08.36]1 Handa mayaṁ dhammābhigītiṁ karomase
[06:15.25]2 Svākkhātat'ādiguṇa-yoga-vasena seyyo
[06:22.97]3 Yo magga-pāka-pariyatti-vimokkha-bhedo
[06:29.60]4 Dhammo kuloka-patanā tada-dhāri-dhārī
[06:35.74]5 Vandām'ahaṁ tama-haraṁ vara-dhammam-etaṁ
[06:42.12]6 Dhammo yo sabba-pāṇīnaṁ saraṇaṁ khemam-uttamaṁ
[06:49.96]7 Dutiyānussatiṭṭhānaṁ vandāmi taṁ siren'ahaṁ
[06:57.81]8 Dhammassāh'asmi dāso va dhammo me sāmi-kissaro
[07:05.90]9 Dhammo dukkhassa ghātā ca vidhātā ca hitassa me
[07:13.29]10 Dhammass'āhaṁ niyyādemi sarīrañ-jīvitañ-cidaṁ
[07:21.37]11 Vandantohaṁ carissāmi dhammass'eva sudhammataṁ
[07:28.80]12 Natthi me saraṇaṁ aññaṁ dhammo me saraṇaṁ varaṁ
[07:36.52]13 Etena sacca-vajjena vaḍḍheyyaṁ satthu-sāsane
[07:44.32]14 Dhammaṁ me vandamānena yaṁ puññaṁ pasutaṁ idha
[07:52.01]15 Sabbepi antarāyā me māhesuṁ tassa tejasā
[08:00.29]17 Kāyena vācāya va cetasā vā
[08:04.20]18 Dhamme kukammaṁ pakataṁ mayā yaṁ
[08:08.11]19 Dhammo paṭiggaṇhātu accayantaṁ
[08:14.04]20 Kālantare saṁvarituṁ va dhamme

[chant:0014 recollection-of-the-sangha]
[08:19.66]1 Handa mayaṁ saṅghānussatinayaṁ karomase
[08:26.76]2 Supaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:34.33]3 Ujupaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:40.99]4 Ñāyapaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:47.98]5 Sāmīcipaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:55.25]6 Yadidaṁ cattāri purisayugāni aṭṭha purisapuggalā
[09:03.29]7 Esa bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[09:08.86]8 Āhuneyyo pāhuneyyo dakkhiṇeyyo añjali-karaṇīyo
[09:17.88]9 Anuttaraṁ puññakkhettaṁ lokassā'ti

[chant:0015 supreme-praise-of-the-sangha]
[09:25.67]1 Handa mayaṁ saṅghābhigītiṁ karomase
[09:32.31]2 Saddhammajo supaṭipatti-guṇādiyutto
[09:39.06]3 Yo'ṭṭhabbidho ariyapuggala-saṅgha-seṭṭho
[09:45.39]4 Sīlādidhamma-pavarāsaya-kāya-citto
[09:51.65]5 Vandām'ahaṁ tam-ariyāna-gaṇaṁ susuddhaṁ
[09:57.90]6 Saṅgho yo sabba-pāṇīnaṁ saraṇaṁ khemam-uttamaṁ
[10:05.95]7 Tatiyānussatiṭṭhānaṁ vandāmi taṁ siren'ahaṁ
[10:13.31]8 Saṅghass'āhasmi dāso va saṅgho me sāmi-kissaro
[10:21.30]9 Saṅgho dukkhassa ghātā ca vidhātā ca hitassa me
[10:29.22]10 Saṅghass'āhaṁ niyyādemi sarīrañ-jīvitañ-cidaṁ
[10:36.74]11 Vandanto'haṁ carissāmi saṅghassopaṭipannataṁ
[10:44.74]12 Natthi me saraṇaṁ aññaṁ saṅgho me saraṇaṁ varaṁ
[10:51.97]13 Etena sacca-vajjena vaḍḍheyyaṁ satthu-sāsane
[10:59.70]14 Saṅghaṁ me vandamānena yaṁ puññaṁ pasutaṁ idha
[11:07.54]15 Sabbepi antarāyā me māhesuṁ tassa tejasā
[11:15.30]17 Kāyena vācāya va cetasā vā
[11:19.47]18 Saṅghe kukammaṁ pakataṁ mayā yaṁ
[11:23.63]19 Saṅgho paṭiggaṇhātu accayantaṁ
[11:29.42]20 Kālantare saṁvarituṁ va saṅghe
